# This file is generated by dune, edit dune-project instead
opam-version: "2.0"
version: "0.1.0"
synopsis:
  "OCaml bindings for Hexaly Optimizer (interval, list, set variables included)"
description: """
Idiomatic OCaml interface to the Hexaly Optimizer (formerly LocalSolver), a commercial mathematical optimization solver. Binds the C++ HexalyOptimizer/HxModel/HxExpression API through a thin extern "C" shim and hand-written OCaml C stubs for near-zero per-call overhead.

Features:
- Bool, int, float, interval, list, and set decision variables.
- Full arithmetic, math, logical, comparison, array, and scheduling operators.
- Lexicographic multi-objective optimization via HxPhase.
- Callbacks with proper OCaml runtime-lock handling for solver-worker threads.
- Typed errors (Hexaly_error of Error.code * string) mirroring HxErrorCode.
- Inconsistency analysis (IIS) for diagnosing infeasible models.
- Warm-start hints via initial-solution setters.
- A bundled mock backend so the library builds and the test suite runs without a Hexaly install (useful for CI and contributors without a license).

The Hexaly Optimizer itself is proprietary; obtain a free academic license, 30-day trial, or commercial license from https://www.hexaly.com/."""
maintainer: ["Aalok Thakkar <thakkar@ashoka.edu.in>"]
authors: ["Aalok Thakkar"]
license: "MIT"
tags: [
  "optimization"
  "solver"
  "constraint-programming"
  "operations-research"
  "milp"
  "scheduling"
  "routing"
  "hexaly"
  "localsolver"
]
homepage: "https://github.com/aalok-thakkar/ocaml-hexaly"
doc: "https://aalok-thakkar.github.io/ocaml-hexaly"
bug-reports: "https://github.com/aalok-thakkar/ocaml-hexaly/issues"
depends: [
  "ocaml" {>= "4.14"}
  "dune" {>= "3.0" & >= "3.0"}
  "dune-configurator"
  "alcotest" {>= "1.5" & with-test}
  "fmt" {>= "0.9" & with-test}
  "odoc" {with-doc}
]
build: [
  ["dune" "subst"] {dev}
  [
    "dune"
    "build"
    "-p"
    name
    "-j"
    jobs
    "@install"
    "@runtest" {with-test}
    "@doc" {with-doc}
  ]
]
dev-repo: "git+https://github.com/aalok-thakkar/ocaml-hexaly.git"
